{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Your secret weapon for a peaceful bedtime. The Iris marries the time-tested, relaxing aromas of pure Lavender buds and sweet Chamomile extracts. Ideal for your nightly routine, this calming bar gently cleanses sensitive skin while its soothing aromatherapy coaxes active minds into a state of restful relaxation.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>The Iris is a parent's best friend and the ultimate addition to your family's evening bedtime routine. It utilizes a maximum safety dilution of time-tested calming herbs to quiet active minds and bodies. The steamy vapor created in a warm bath helps transition your child from high-energy playtime to deep, restful relaxation.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Pure Lavender Oil (Lavandula Angustifolia): Renowned for its natural sedative aromatherapeutic qualities. Inhaling its gentle steam lowers heart rate sensations and stress hormones, preparing children for a peaceful sleep cycle</li>
                    <li>Roman Chamomile Oil (Anthemis Nobilis): Works in perfect harmony with lavender to relax tense, growing muscles while soothing any minor skin irritations or diaper redness accumulated throughout the day</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Evening wind-downs and active minds.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Goat's Milk Base, Aloe Vera Base, Organic Lavender Oil, Organic Roman Chamomile Oil, Organic Banana Oil, Sweet Orange Oil, Natural Coloring, and Natural Preservative.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Use during a warm nightly bath or shower to help your little one prepare for a deep, restful sleep.</p></div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-care' %}
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Storage / Safety Disclaimer<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <p><strong>Safety Disclaimer:</strong> For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of infants without supervision.</p>
    <p><strong>Aromatherapy &amp; Herbal Note:</strong> This product is hand-crafted with active botanicals, natural clays, and pure essential oils. We recommend performing a patch test on a small area of skin before your first full use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or under medical supervision, consult your physician before using bars containing high concentrations of essential oils.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-shipping' %}
{%- endif -%}
